== 9. Verdict against the pre-set criterion ==================== 
  ADEQUATE            = >= 10% of melanocytes after thinning 
  INFORMATIVE ABSENCE = below that AND eccrine >= 3x melanocyte, or 
                        abundance-matched genes >= 3x 
  UNINFORMATIVE       = below that AND neither reference is higher 
 
  RASSF9: INFORMATIVE ABSENCE -- the assay can see genes like this; melanocytes lack it 
    melanocyte 0.08% | eccrine 6.32% (80.67x) | matched-gene median 0.13% (1.60x) 
 
  RASSF10: INFORMATIVE ABSENCE -- the assay can see genes like this; melanocytes lack it 
    melanocyte 0.11% | eccrine 53.41% (486.73x) | matched-gene median 0.20% (1.86x) 
 
  WHAT THIS CANNOT SAY: this dataset has no nevus melanocytes and no 
  melanoma, so it cannot deliver Gustavo's three-way comparison on 
  its own. It establishes the normal-melanocyte arm, and whether that 
  arm is measurable at all. 

